EVALUATION.md §1, CODEGEN.md §5.1: gen/cpp writes a list constant as a braced initializer of scalars, so a constant holding a record, of its own package too, is RecordConstant.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A point.
record Point {
  /// Across.
  x: Int
}

/// The origins.
const origins = [Point { x: 0 }]

/// Numbers, fine.
const ns = [1, 2]

emit cpp { out: "@features/a", namespace: "a", mode: data }
-- a.origins.json --
[{"x": 0}]
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:10:7
  emit cpp in data mode cannot generate a constant of a record or variant type; make it a let

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
